# Generated / assisted by Claude
# Human approval for a draft that mission_gate parked after receiving a GroundTask.
# The approval is valid for exactly this draft and is not remembered: a refused call leaves the
# draft pending, an accepted call consumes it. Drafts expire (mission_gate parameter draft_ttl_s).
# Only an operator UI or a hardware switch should call this service; planners / LLM agents must not.

string mission_id
bool arm_approval
bool takeoff_approval
